{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2s1j1mv4","type":"work","subtype":"book","title":"崇禎存實疏鈔","authors":[],"description":{"text":"崇禎五年至六年（1632-1633）間題本鈔本之匯編，共八卷。內容多為吏部、戶部、兵部、工部、禮部、都察院、各科給事中、各道御史等衙門官員題本，涉軍政、考成、戰事（剿西北流寇、登州孔有德之亂、海防、邊鎮）、財政、考察等諸事。編者不詳，疑為崇禎間史官或閣臣為輯存當時要疏所鈔。八卷分藏於總匯第80-83冊。","sources":[]},"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":8}],"measure_info":"八卷","publication_info":{"year":"1633","details":"明崇禎五年至六年題本（後輯）"},"resources":[{"id":"archive_org","name":"Internet Archive 影印本","url":"https://archive.org/search?query=series%3A%22%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E6%98%8E%E6%9C%9D%E6%AA%94%E6%A1%88%E7%B8%BD%E5%8C%AF%22&sort=identifier","volumes":[{"volume":80,"url":"https://archive.org/details/zhongguo-mingchao-dangan-zonghui-vol080","status":"found"},{"volume":81,"url":"https://archive.org/details/zhongguo-mingchao-dangan-zonghui-vol081","status":"found"},{"volume":82,"url":"https://archive.org/details/zhongguo-mingchao-dangan-zonghui-vol082","status":"found"},{"volume":83,"url":"https://archive.org/details/zhongguo-mingchao-dangan-zonghui-vol083","status":"found"}],"expected_volumes":4,"types":["image"]}],"contained_in":[{"id":"8rlcsybg2hhj","volume_index":"第80-83冊"}],"updated_at":"2026-07-31T04:34:52+00:00","_has_collated":true,"_has_image":true,"ai_note":"2026-08-25 無斷代批次收尾：**本條無傳統著錄源，非漏填**——或為近現代之學術著作／整理叢書（歷代志書自無從著錄），或其著錄之據已載於 description。依使用者 2026-08-25 之裁定（實在補不齊者注明即可升格）逕行升格。","revision":"1.0.0","revised_at":"2026-08-25","has_collated":true,"has_image":true,"_path":"Work/m/v/4/d59f2s1j1mv4-崇禎存實疏鈔.json","_isDraft":false}